                                "value": "<p>[fol. 463r]</p><p>Ratificatio etc.<span class=\"line-break\"><br></span>Die vigesimaquinta Novembris 1623</p><p></p><p>Fuit facta Cong<em>regati</em>o generalis DD. Pictor<em>um</em> et Sculptor<em>um</em> de<span class=\"line-break\"><br></span>Urbe in Ecc<em>lesi</em>a Sancti Luca<em>e</em> in Solitis <em>a</em>edibus Sancti Luca<em>e</em><span class=\"line-break\"><br></span>in Campo Bovario seu Rom<em>an</em>o in qua interfuerunt<span class=\"line-break\"><br></span>omnes inf<em>r</em>a<em>scripti</em> V<em>ide</em>l<em>ice</em>t<span class=\"line-break\"><br></span>Ill.' D Augustinus Ciampellus Princeps<span class=\"line-break\"><br></span>D. Petrus Continus <em>Secundu</em>s Rector<span class=\"line-break\"><br></span>D. Pompeus Ferruccius P<em>rimu</em>s Consiliarius<span class=\"line-break\"><br></span>D. Paulus Brillus <em>Secundu</em>s Consiliarius<span class=\"line-break\"><br></span>D. Hieronymus Masseus P<em>rimu</em>s Censor<span class=\"line-break\"><br></span>D. Antevidutus Grammatica Camerarius<span class=\"line-break\"><br></span>D. Eq<em>ues</em> Io: Balleonus<span class=\"line-break\"><br></span>D. Baccius Ciarpius<span class=\"line-break\"><br></span>D. Andreas Lilius<span class=\"line-break\"><br></span>R. D. Franciscus Gricciottus<span class=\"line-break\"><br></span>D. Bernardinus Gubellanus<span class=\"line-break\"><br></span>D. Alexander Cinus<span class=\"line-break\"><br></span>D. Bonettus de Bonettis<span class=\"line-break\"><br></span>D. Io'es Caballinus<span class=\"line-break\"><br></span>D. Honophrius Neophitus<span class=\"line-break\"><br></span>D. Guerruccius Totti<span class=\"line-break\"><br></span>D. Gaspar Ferrerius<span class=\"line-break\"><br></span>D. Gregorius Continus</p>"
